  "body": "**Description:**\r\nI would like the ability to disable end-to-end encryption in my self hosted Synapse instance.  I have a legal requirement to provide audit-able chat logs, which is obviously impossible if there's nothing preventing my end-users from encrypting any room they create.\r\n\r\nI originally created an issue for [riot-web here](https://github.com/vector-im/riot-web/issues/8067), thinking this was an entirely client-side feature.  But I suspect there may be a client-side component to fully implementing this feature.\r\n<!-- Describe here the feature you are requesting. -->\r\n",
